# Homelessness SBA (Comm360 internship) — Cast
#
# Built from "Homelessness SBA Storyboard_2 (v Sept 16).pptx". Every avatar is
# the image the storyboard uses for that character (images/), not a generated
# lo-blocks avatar: a `src:` image always wins over generated styles.
#
#   * Instructor — the course instructor who opens the module (slide 1)
#   * Lianne     — Lianne Park, supervisor / mentor at Comm360
#   * Anne       — Anne Hastings, CEO of Comm360 (introduced, not a speaker)
#   * Ty, Peggy, Lacy — the student's fellow interns
#   * You        — the student
#
# Used by Chat and TeamDirectory. Speaker keys contain no periods (chatpeg
# parser limitation); display names are set with `name:`.

Instructor:
  name: Your Instructor
  src: images/instructor.jpg
  profile:
    role: Course Instructor
    bio: Your instructor for the interdisciplinary studies course, who introduces the simulated research project.

Lianne:
  name: Lianne Park
  src: images/lianne.jpg
  profile:
    role: Supervisor / Mentor, Comm360
    bio: Lianne has been at Comm360 for five years and directs multiple programs. She will present the team's findings and work to the Program Development & Evaluation (PDE) committee for review.
    experience: Five years at Comm360
    skills:
      - Program Development
      - Program Evaluation
      - Mentoring
  groups:
    - comm360

Anne:
  name: Anne Hastings
  src: images/anne.jpg
  profile:
    role: Chief Executive Officer (CEO), Comm360
    bio: Ms. Hastings makes the ultimate decisions about Comm360's programs and resources. Lianne reports to her.
  groups:
    - comm360

Ty:
  name: Ty
  src: images/ty.png
  profile:
    role: Intern, Comm360
    bio: One of your fellow interns. Quick to run a keyword search and bring a new study to the team.
  groups:
    - comm360
    - interns

Peggy:
  name: Peggy
  src: images/peggy.png
  profile:
    role: Intern, Comm360
    bio: One of your fellow interns. Her family experienced housing instability when she was in middle school, so this topic feels personal to her.
  groups:
    - comm360
    - interns

Lacy:
  name: Lacy
  src: images/lacy.png
  profile:
    role: Intern, Comm360
    bio: One of your fellow interns. She studied focus groups in her research methods class and analyzed many transcripts.
  groups:
    - comm360
    - interns

You:
  name: You
  src: images/you.jpg
